abc\e<pause>0\C-xX\e<pause>.<dumpfull>.<dumpfull>\r

=== api-start-c-redo-empty-line
tags: rl_vi_start_inserting api
--- script
def s
rl_vi_start_inserting "c" 1 1
end
defun start s
rl_bind_keyseq_in_map "\C-x" start vi-command
readline "> "
--- keys
\e<pause>\C-xX\e<pause>.<dumpfull>\r

=== api-start-s-redo-no-motion
tags: rl_vi_start_inserting api
--- script
def s
rl_vi_start_inserting "s" 1 1
end
defun start s
rl_bind_keyseq_in_map "\C-x" start vi-command
