=== api-start-C-redo-to-end
tags: rl_vi_start_inserting api
--- script
def s
rl_vi_start_inserting "C" 1 1
end
defun start s
rl_bind_keyseq_in_map "\C-x" start vi-command
readline "> "
--- keys
abc\e<pause>0\C-xX\e<pause>.<dumpfull>\r

=== initial-insert-saved-after-S
tags: vi-subst
--- script
readline "> " 2
--- keys
\e<pause>S\rw6-\e<pause><dumpfull>.<dumpfull>\r

=== initial-insert-saved-after-S-text
tags: vi-subst
--- script
readline "> " 2
--- keys
\e<pause>Sab\rw6-\e<pause><dumpfull>.<dumpfull>\r

=== x-kept-across-lines
tags: vi-delete
--- script
readline "> " 2
--- keys
abc\e<pause>x\rw6-\e<pause>0.<dumpfull>\r

=== i-text-replaced-by-next-line
tags: vi-insertion-mode
--- script
readline "> " 2
--- keys
\e<pause>iab\rw6-\e<pause>.<dumpfull>\r

=== cw-redo-uses-next-line-insert
tags: vi-change-to
--- script
readline "> " 2
--- keys
abc\e<pause>0cwZ\rw6- x\e<pause>0.<dumpfull>\r

=== failed-X-recorded
tags: vi-rubout
keys: abc\e<pause>0X.<dump>\r

=== failed-tilde-recorded
tags: vi-change-case
keys: \e<pause>~.x<dump>\r

=== failed-x-recorded
tags: vi-delete
keys: \e<pause>x.x<dump>\r

=== r-on-empty-recorded
tags: vi-change-char
keys: \e<pause>rz.x<dump>\r

=== aborted-put-not-recorded
tags: vi-put
keys: abc\e<pause>0p.<dump>\r

=== aborted-Put-not-recorded
tags: vi-put
keys: abc\e<pause>0P.<dump>\r

=== failed-motion-operator-recorded
tags: vi-delete-to
keys: abc\e<pause>0dfz.<dump>\r

=== invalid-motion-operator-recorded
tags: vi-delete-to
keys: abc\e<pause>0dq.<dump>\r

=== failed-change-recorded
tags: vi-change-to
keys: abc\e<pause>0cfz.<dump>\r

=== failed-yank-recorded
tags: vi-yank-to
keys: abc\e<pause>0yfz.<dump>\r

=== eof-after-count-next-prompt
tags: vi-arg-digit eof show-mode-in-prompt
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
set keyseq-timeout 50
set show-mode-in-prompt on
--- script
readline "> "
readline "> "
--- keys
ñ\e<pause>026
